# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of AI skills for Qiskit quantum computing workflows."
msgstr "Overview ng mga AI skill para sa mga workflow ng quantum computing gamit ang Qiskit."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills"
msgstr "Mga Qiskit AI skill"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills {#qiskit-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Mga Qiskit AI skill {#qiskit-ai-skills}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Qiskit AI skills repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) has a set of skills that you can use with AI assistants, such as Bob, Claude, or ChatGPT. An AI skill is a reusable set of instructions that teaches the assistant how to complete a specific task.  Skills can help save time and ensure that repeatable tasks are done consistently and correctly.  \n"
msgstr "Ang [Qiskit AI skills repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) ay may set ng mga skill na magagamit mo kasama ng mga AI assistant, tulad ng Bob, Claude, o ChatGPT. Ang isang AI skill ay isang reusable na set ng mga instructions na nagtuturo sa assistant kung paano kumpletuhin ang isang partikular na task. Nakakatulong ang mga skill na makatipid ng oras at masiguro na ang mga paulit-ulit na task ay nagagawa nang pare-pareho at tama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a Qiskit AI skill, follow the instructions for your AI assistant.  In general, you just need to give the skill to the assistant, then tell it where to apply the skill.\n"
msgstr "Para gamitin ang isang Qiskit AI skill, sundin ang mga instructions para sa iyong AI assistant. Sa pangkalahatan, kailangan mo lang ibigay ang skill sa assistant, tapos sabihin dito kung saan i-apply ang skill.\n"

# doq: translated after #1094 review 2026-11-21
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation {#installation}"
msgstr "Pag-install {#installation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These skills follow the [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) standard and can\n"
"be installed into compatible AI coding agents using the [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills), through\n"
"native agent plugin marketplaces, or by cloning the repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sinusunod ng mga skill na ito ang [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) standard at puwedeng\n"
"i-install sa mga compatible na AI coding agent gamit ang [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills), sa pamamagitan ng\n"
"native na agent plugin marketplace, o sa pag-clone ng repository.\n"

# doq: translated after #1094 review 2026-11-21
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start {#quick-start}"
msgstr "Mabilis na pagsisimula {#quick-start}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The easiest way to install is with the [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills):\n"
msgstr "Ang pinakamadaling paraan ng pag-install ay gamit ang [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills):\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This will prompt you to pick which agent(s) to install for and whether to install globally or just for the current project.\n"
msgstr "Itatanong nito kung para sa aling agent(s) ka mag-i-install at kung global ba ang pag-install o para lang sa kasalukuyang proyekto.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Install a specific skill:**\n"
msgstr "**Mag-install ng partikular na skill:**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Keep installed skills current:**\n"
msgstr "**Panatilihing updated ang mga naka-install na skill:**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install as a plugin {#install-as-a-plugin}"
msgstr "I-install bilang plugin {#install-as-a-plugin}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Claude Code {#claude-code}"
msgstr "Claude Code {#claude-code}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install using the [plugin marketplace](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github):\n"
msgstr "Mag-install gamit ang [plugin marketplace](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github):\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Codex {#codex}"
msgstr "Codex {#codex}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cursor {#cursor}"
msgstr "Cursor {#cursor}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from the Cursor marketplace if available, or use the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent cursor`. See [Cursor plugins docs](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Mag-install mula sa Cursor marketplace kung available, o gamitin ang [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) sa itaas na may `--agent cursor`. Tingnan ang [Cursor plugins docs](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) para sa karagdagang impormasyon.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"
msgstr "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bob has no plugin/marketplace step — it reads `SKILL.md` files directly from `.bob/skills/` in a cloned project. The repository symlinks the skills to `.bob/skills/<name>`  so cloning the repo is sufficient.\n"
msgstr "Walang plugin/marketplace step ang Bob — direkta nitong binabasa ang mga `SKILL.md` file mula sa `.bob/skills/` sa isang na-clone na proyekto. Naka-symlink ang mga skill ng repository sa `.bob/skills/<name>`  kaya sapat na ang pag-clone ng repo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also install with the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent bob`.\n"
msgstr "Puwede ka ring mag-install gamit ang [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) sa itaas na may `--agent bob`.\n"

# doq: translated after #1094 review 2026-11-21
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone / Copy {#clone--copy}"
msgstr "I-clone / Kopyahin {#clone--copy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your agent does not support a native plugin or the skills CLI, clone this repo and copy the desired skill directory to the agent's supported skill directory:\n"
msgstr "Kung hindi sinusuportahan ng agent mo ang native plugin o ang skills CLI, i-clone ang repo na ito at kopyahin ang gusto mong skill directory papunta sa skill directory na sinusuportahan ng agent:\n"

